{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:50 2026-08-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:14 2026-08-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:14 2026-08-13 HKT</p><p>屯門華發街16號對開山邊樓梯，今晨（13日）6時許有一隻約1.5米長的野豬，被發現夾困於欄杆之間，無法脫身。消防員趕到，只見涉事野豬大半邊身伏在梯級上，其屁股和兩條後腿則懸在欄杆外，於是用紅布遮蔽野豬以防牠受驚亂動，並通知愛護動物協會到場協助拯救。人員最後剪開欄杆，將野豬救出，放入籠裏帶走檢查。</p><img alt=\"野豬夾困在欄杆之間，無法脫身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b1cc210683391b0b6466c59728637c9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-13_at_08_09_04_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/443a7504b43c37f59841a79f8664de2d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-13_at_08_09_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員到場拯救野豬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03046dcc1a86ceceec48e2cae4143308/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-13_at_07_57_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防通知愛協人員到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd3454ae1a71285fa430ab3037d25c06/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-13_at_08_09_03.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68915af6c87cc78e1b1c22b3287951c0/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-13_at_08_09_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"野豬約1.5米長。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7763ba80377935c8682a2900b2e8556e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-13_at_08_08_58.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T01:23:59.984349+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}